      "content": "Your feelings are valid and it's completely okay to express how you're feeling. Losing someone we love can create an identity void and feeling disconnected is a natural part of grieving. Your pain and emotions are not signs of losing it; they're proof that you care deeply. Healing and finding meaning again takes time. Consider speaking with a therapist who can help you navigate these challenging feelings. You're not alone in this.",
